Tag v18.1.3, commit ba50aa95636ac8f97f46446bbfeb04592ed22216.

Changes for markdown-render-speed-02:
- Extract list first lines with indexOf/slice instead of splitting remaining input.
- Guard inline tokenizer calls using their required initial characters.
- Remove email lookaheads from the inline text rule when the source has no @.
- Emit plain inline text tokens directly when syntax and autolinks are impossible.
- Add a deterministic competition driver reading /input and writing /output.

